%% EvaporChain — Transaction Lifecycle
%% Renders on GitHub natively. mermaid.live for local preview.

flowchart TD
    A[Client signs Transaction<br/>ML-DSA / ECDSA / Hybrid] --> B[Submit via JSON-RPC<br/>evaporchain-node API]
    B --> C{Mempool admit?}
    C -->|sig fail / wrong nonce / over quota| Z1[Reject<br/>return error to client]
    C -->|admit| D[Mempool<br/>per-account ≤ 64 / TTL eviction / total ≤ 10K]
    D --> E[Gossip to peers<br/>libp2p GossipSub]
    E --> F[Proposer selected for height H<br/>VRF + stake-weighted]
    F --> G[Build block<br/>up to 10K txs / 500K gas]
    G --> H[Block-STM parallel execution<br/>MVCC + abort/retry]
    H -->|cycle / overload| H2[Serial fallback]
    H2 --> I
    H --> I[Apply state changes<br/>RocksDB write batch]
    I --> J[Compute state_root + data_root<br/>Verkle + 2D erasure*]
    J --> K[Broadcast Proposal<br/>Tendermint consensus]
    K --> L[Prevote → Precommit → Commit<br/>2/3 stake-weighted quorum]
    L --> M[BLS aggregate signature<br/>CommitCertificate]
    M --> N[Block finalized<br/>FinalityTracker.on_block_finalized]
    N --> O[DA attestation round<br/>BLS supermajority over data_root]
    O --> P[Client polls receipt<br/>tx visible at finality]

    style C fill:#fff3cd
    style H fill:#cfe2ff
    style L fill:#d1e7dd
    style N fill:#d1e7dd

    %% * As of 2026-04-27 the 2D erasure encoder is wired into all 3
    %% producers via compute_block_da #40;commit 1fc67c0#41;. Empty
    %% blocks ship a sentinel data_root #40;blake3#40;"evaporchain:empty_block"#41;#41;
    %% so DA attestation rounds fire on every block. Closed K-04.
